enunu09", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199466959074/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 18, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 18, "last_played": 1682850838, "avatar": "543bb32f9249e6738288c0d3ac6987ee25983c41"}, "language": "english", "review": "I barely got to play this since for some damn reason trh screen was wide so I had to refund the game if anyone knows a fix to this please tell me. \n\n\nFor now I'm stuck with 4.1 which is still awesome \n", "timestamp_created": 1692796111, "timestamp_updated": 1692796111, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": true, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 14, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "144639499", "author": {"steamid": "76561198331869405", "personaname": "Kchalico", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198331869405/", "num_games_owned": 366, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 6370, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2720, "last_played": 1780118783, "avatar": "8dfe278c7493b6984540e57ecd57b791df13841e"}, "language": "english", "review": "ants, spider, frog, bald humanoid is dead only EDF! EDF!\nneed more improvement in the carcas? or corpse its can be shield temporarty and can become obstacle\n", "timestamp_created": 1692535511, "timestamp_updated": 1692535511, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "144604972", "author": {"steamid": "76561198074323599", "personaname": "Ballasaurus Flex", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/BallasaurusFlex/", "num_games_owned": 884, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 30864, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 30860, "last_played": 1717120852, "avatar": "846b33f501720fa3f011ec26e35a0063f1fbc85d"}, "language": "english", "review": "⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n[h1][b][i]Bugs. Big Bugs. Giant Guns. Just Another Tuesday.[/i][/b][/h1][h1][/h1]Remember when you were a child and you'd pretend that ants were giant monsters attacking your toy soldiers? Well, this is that... but with lasers, rockets, and a seemingly endless supply of pure chaotic energy.[h1][/h1][b]Pros:[/b][list][*]Finally found a game that truly captures the horror of spotting a cockroach in the kitchen – but on a global scale.[*]The EDF chant is now my morning alarm, my workout track, and my lullaby.[*]10/10 would recommend yelling \"FOR THE EDF!\" randomly in public spaces.[*]Did I mention there's a gun that shoots buildings? Because there is.[/list][h1][/h1][b]Cons:[/b][list][*]After playing, regular-sized bugs just don't seem intimidating anymore. Tried to negotiate with a spider in my shower. It didn't go well.[*]My neighbors have filed several noise complaints. They don't understand the necessity of shouting \"EDF!\" at the top of my lungs at 2 AM.[*]I now evaluate my life choices based on how well they'd fare against a giant alien ant invasion.[/list][h1][/h1]In a nutshell, EARTH DEFENSE FORCE 5 is the fever dream of every action movie and Saturday morning cartoon you loved as a kid, rolled into a delightful and chaotic gaming experience. And the best part? The bigger they are, the harder they explode.[h1]Join the EDF! We have big guns and even bigger bugs. It's a blast, literally. 🐜💥🔫[/h1]", "timestamp_created": 1692493096, "timestamp_updated": 1692493096, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}]}